{
    "title": "Bingo Quest: Summer Adventure",
    "description": "Shout out a cheer! Bingo Quest <i>SUMMER</i> Garden Offline Games is here!  Featuring ALL NEW artwork showcasing the beauty of the season!\r\n\r\nTravel along the map into 4 picturesque super Summer worlds. Walk through manicured flower gardens at home, unruly and mysterious forests, and even with the occasional beautiful beast! Are you ready to discover all that the newest super Bingo Quest has to offer? \r\n\r\n<b>IMMERSE YOURSELF IN THE BLOOMING WORLD OF BINGO QUEST - SUMMER GARDEN ADVENTURE! </b>\r\nBingo Quest Summer Garden will take you on an adventure and journey through the hot summer sun featuring beautiful artwork and relaxing scenery. An excellent free and fun bingo game featuring offline play that you can enjoy at home!\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>ADVENTURE THROUGH BEAUTIFUL LANDS WITH 80 LEVELS OF ABSOLUTE FREE BINGO</b>\r\nAs you progress through our free board game adventure, you\u2019ll have the chance to explore new lucky areas in the land of four seasons.  Adore the summer birds and waterfalls along your bingo games journey and, with 80 levels of free bingo waiting for you in the gardens, you\u2019ll have hours of fun in this beautiful garden land! You can even play these board games offline!\r\n\r\n<b>UNLOCK STUNNING FREE BINGO QUEST: SUMMER ADVENTURE ARTWORK</b>\r\nCollect super puzzle pieces as you play bingo with the the summer babies \u2013 use these puzzle pieces to unlock beautifully illustrated artwork of the otherworldly garden realm. Collect graphics of detailed, beautiful gardens and flowers as you progress through the game. Can you collect them all? \r\n\r\n<b>SPIN THE MAGICAL WHEEL OF FORTUNE</b>\r\nEvery day you can visit the wheel of fortune \u2013 rumored to give those who spin it an absolute free reward every 24 hours. Receive extra daubers, coins, keys, lucky charms,  and more, so be sure to visit every day and claim your free prize!\r\n\r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n<b>BINGO QUEST SUMMER GARDEN ADVENTURE \u2013 HIGHLIGHTS</b>\r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\u2605 Play through 80 levels of fantastic free bingo games\r\n\u2605 Unlock stunning artwork of the wondrous gardens and flowers\r\n\u2605 Spin the magical wheel of fortune for free lucky charms, prizes and rewards\r\n\u2605 Use your keys to unlock treasure chests at the end of each level \u2013 what could they contain?\r\n\u2605 Change the bingo caller speed\r\n\r\n\r\nFor a refreshing, fun and free bingo offline games experience, look no further than Bingo Quest Summer Garden Adventure!. Full of beauty and adventure, you\u2019ll have hours of fun playing bingo in the beautiful garden paradise. Why play anywhere else? \r\n\r\n==============================================================\r\nCOME AND PLAY BINGO IN THE SUMMER GARDENS \u2013 DOWNLOAD BINGO QUEST FOR FREE TODAY!\r\n==============================================================",
